# cargo-fuzz generated artefacts.
target/
artifacts/
coverage/
Cargo.lock

# libfuzzer-generated corpus entries are NOT committed by default —
# they regenerate on every run and can grow to tens of MB. The only
# entries we keep in git are permanent regression seeds (panics /
# OOMs that a past fuzz run surfaced and a commit has since fixed),
# named `regression-<topic>-<YYYY-MM-DD>` so future runs re-check
# the exact triggering input.
#
# We exclude `corpus/*/*` (subpath level) rather than `corpus/`
# (directory level) because git's gitignore can't re-include files
# inside an already-excluded directory.
corpus/*/*
!corpus/*/regression-*
